{"sections":[{"slug":"代数簇","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"代数簇"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">代数簇</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“代数簇”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">代数簇是</span> $\\mathbb{C} P^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">上齐次多项式的公共零点集</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">抽象</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">内蕴</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h3>\n<p>Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">将抽象的代数簇定义为代数闭域上整</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">可分</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">有限型的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">经典的代数簇还要加上</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟射影簇","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟射影簇</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的条件</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">复流形</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/复流形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">复流形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $M$, <span lang=\"zh\">若存在足够大的</span> $n$, <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">可嵌入</span> $\\mathbb{C}P^n$, <span lang=\"zh\">则称其为</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">非奇异</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">代数簇</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这个定义是由于著名的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/周炜良定理","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">周炜良定理</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">是代数簇</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Kähler流形","text":"Kähler <span lang=\"zh\">流形</span>"}},{"Plain":"; <span lang=\"zh\">特别地</span>, $H^2(M;\\mathbb{R})\\neq 0$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">仿射代数簇</span></h3>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">反例</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">不是代数簇的复流形</span></h3>\n<p>$S^3\\times S^3$ <span lang=\"zh\">上有复结构</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">由</span> $T^2$ <span lang=\"zh\">作用</span> $T^2\\to S^3\\times S^3 \\to S^2\\times S^2$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出</span>), <span lang=\"zh\">但它不是代数簇</span>.</p>\n<p><strong>Hopf <span lang=\"zh\">曲面</span></strong> $S^1\\times S^3$ <span lang=\"zh\">的复结构由</span> $\\mathbb{C}^2\\setminus\\{0\\}\\big/ \\mathbb{Z}$ <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $n\\in\\mathbb{Z}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的作用是乘以</span> $2^n$. <span lang=\"zh\">它不是代数簇</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}